    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d324">

                <pb facs="0529" n="433" sameAs="frus:frus1872p1/pg433"/>

                <head>No. 324.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Nelson to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1872-06-25"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi> 25, 1872</date>.
                        (Received July 13.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 585.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: On the occasion of the retirement of Mr.
                    Romero from the ministry of finance, I thought it due to the valuable services
                    he has rendered this legation to address him a complimentary note, a copy of
                    which is herewith inclosed, (A,) together with that gentleman’s reply to the
                    same, (B.)</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>THOMAS H. NELSON.</signed>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d324-a1.xml" xpointer="d324-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d324-a2.xml" xpointer="d324-a2"/>
            </div>
